WEBVTT

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.440
Choose Internet Archive. Press A on Play to
listen.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:20.340
Mark in and out. Render the selection to a new
wave file.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:28.220
Zoom to a hit. In Chop, preview a slice. Match
the level with Gain D B.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:41.570
Load six sounds in Drumlab. Generate a rhythm,
move a hit, then send it to a phrase.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:53.499
Build a chain from phrases. In Song, set their
order. Find M eight import under Projects.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:06.340
Missed a sound on the radio? Rewind the buffer.
Select opens help while the stream plays.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:20.660
Choose a synth model or load a preset. In
Sample Granular, move the read point through
the waveform.

00:01:26.050 --> 00:01:28.140
Hear the dry beat first. Then, hold A.

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.890
Resample the mix. Open the take in the Sample
Editor.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:12.530
Use delay or reverb to add space. Keep enough
headroom at the master.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.700
Choose a theme. Set the beat guides for Chain
and Phrase separately.

